---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About — Nazmul">
  <h1 class="page-title"><span class="prompt">$</span> cat about.md</h1>

  <div class="about-body">
    <p>
      I'm Nazmul, based in Bavaria, Germany, working toward a role as a
      DevOps or Cloud Engineer. I'm currently completing an Ironhack DevOps
      bootcamp covering Linux, Docker, Terraform, Ansible, and AWS —
      building and deploying real infrastructure rather than just studying
      it in isolation.
    </p>

    <p>
      Outside coursework, I build and operate
      <a href="https://flinktrade.com">FlinkTrade</a>, a personal algorithmic
      trading platform — Python/Flask on Kraken Futures, deployed on a
      self-managed Hetzner VPS with Gunicorn, Nginx, and systemd, behind
      Cloudflare. It runs a strict research discipline: every strategy goes
      through walk-forward validation with pre-registered, git-enforced
      pass/fail gates before it's allowed anywhere near live capital, and
      every result — pass or kill — gets logged permanently. That
      discipline matters more to me than any single result: it's the same
      instinct that makes good infrastructure reliable.
    </p>

    <p>
      This site itself is part of that same practice: an Astro static
      site, containerized with Docker, deployed via GitHub Actions to a
      Traefik-fronted Hetzner box, isolated from my production trading
      infrastructure by design.
    </p>

    <h2 class="section-heading"># currently</h2>
    <ul class="status-list">
      <li><span class="status-dot"></span>Finishing the Ironhack DevOps bootcamp</li>
      <li><span class="status-dot"></span>Building out this portfolio and its project writeups</li>
      <li><span class="status-dot"></span>Job-hunting for DevOps / Cloud Engineer roles in Germany</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="cta-row">
      <a href="/cv.pdf" class="cmd-btn primary">./download-cv.sh</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/nhcp" class="cmd-btn">ssh github.com/nhcp</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-title {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .prompt {
    color: var(--accent-teal);
    margin-right: 0.5rem;
  }
  .about-body {
    max-width: 65ch;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }
  .about-body a {
    color: var(--accent-amber);
  }
  .section-heading {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--accent-teal);
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }
  .status-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 1rem 0 2.5rem;
  }
  .status-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .status-dot {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #4ADE80;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .cta-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .cmd-btn {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.1rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    background: var(--bg-surface-hover);
    transition: border-color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .cmd-btn:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent-teal);
  }
  .cmd-btn.primary {
    background: var(--accent-teal);
    color: #06201C;
    border-color: var(--accent-teal);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
